<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>UI Audit Report: Deposits Page</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f3f4f6;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-primary: #111827;
            --text-secondary: #4b5563;
            --accent-color: #2563eb;
            --border-color: #e5e7eb;
            --severity-critical: #dc2626;
            --severity-high: #ea580c;
            --severity-medium: #d97706;
            --severity-low: #65a30d;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 2rem; color: var(--text-primary); }
        h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 0; }

        .subtitle { color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 10px; }

        /* Comparison Grid */
        .comparison-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .comparison-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        .view-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .view-header {
            padding: 16px 24px;
            background: #f9fafb;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            font-weight: 700;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .mockup-container {
            padding: 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 400px;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* The Mock UI Component */
        .error-modal {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 380px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 32px 24px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* Light Mode Mock */
        .mock-light .error-modal {
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
        }
        .mock-light { background-color: #ffffff; } /* Container bg */

        /* Dark Mode Mock */
        .mock-dark { background-color: #111827; }
        .mock-dark .error-modal {
            background: #1f2937;
            border: 1px solid #374151;
        }

        .icon-circle {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            font-size: 32px;
        }
        .mock-light .icon-circle { background: #fee2e2; color: #ef4444; }
        .mock-dark .icon-circle { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color: #ef4444; }

        .modal-title { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .modal-desc { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 28px; line-height: 1.4; }
        .mock-dark .modal-desc { color: #9ca3af; }

        .btn-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }

        .btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }
        .btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
        }
        .mock-dark .btn-primary {
            background: #f3f4f6;
            color: #111827;
        }

        .btn-secondary-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn-ghost {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            color: #374151;
        }
        .mock-dark .btn-ghost {
            border-color: #374151;
            color: #d1d5db;
        }

        /* Findings Section */
        .findings-section h2 {
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding-left: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .issue-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-left-width: 4px;
            border-left-style: solid;
        }

        .issue-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .issue-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; }

        .badge {
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: white;
        }
        .badge.critical { background-color: var(--severity-critical); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--severity-critical); }
        .badge.high { background-color: var(--severity-high); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--severity-high); }
        .badge.medium { background-color: var(--severity-medium); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--severity-medium); }
        .badge.low { background-color: var(--severity-low); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--severity-low); }

        .issue-body { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .issue-meta { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #9ca3af; font-style: italic; }

        /* Specific Border Colors for Issues */
        .issue-card[data-severity="critical"] { border-left-color: var(--severity-critical); }
        .issue-card[data-severity="high"] { border-left-color: var(--severity-high); }
        .issue-card[data-severity="medium"] { border-left-color: var(--severity-medium); }
        .issue-card[data-severity="low"] { border-left-color: var(--severity-low); }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <header>
        <h1>UI Audit: Deposits Error State</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">Comparing Light vs. Dark Mode implementations for Form Readability & Wallet Selector Context.</div>
    </header>

    <!-- Visual Comparison Section -->
    <section class="comparison-grid">
        <!-- Light Mode -->
        <article class="view-card">
            <div class="view-header">
                <span>Light Mode</span>
                <span style="font-size:0.8rem; color:#666;">Reference</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mockup-container mock-light">
                <div class="error-modal">
                    <div class="icon-circle">⚠️</div>
                    <div class="modal-title">Something went wrong</div>
                    <div class="modal-desc">An unexpected error occurred. Please try again or contact support.</div>
                    <div class="btn-group">
                        <button class="btn btn-primary">
                            <span>↻</span> Try Again
                        </button>
                        <div class="btn-secondary-row">
                            <button class="btn btn-ghost"><span>⌂</span> Dashboard</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-ghost"><span>☐</span> Report</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Dark Mode -->
        <article class="view-card">
            <div class="view-header" style="background:#1f2937; color:white; border-bottom-color: #374151;">
                <span>Dark Mode</span>
                <span style="font-size:0.8rem; opacity:0.7;">Target Analysis</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mockup-container mock-dark">
                <div class="error-modal">
                    <div class="icon-circle">⚠️</div>
                    <div class="modal-title" style="color:white;">Something went wrong</div>
                    <div class="modal-desc">An unexpected error occurred. Please try again or contact support.</div>
                    <div class="btn-group">
                        <button class="btn btn-primary">
                            <span>↻</span> Try Again
                        </button>
                        <div class="btn-secondary-row">
                            <button class="btn btn-ghost"><span>⌂</span> Dashboard</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-ghost"><span>☐</span> Report</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </article>
    </section>

    <!-- Audit Findings -->
    <section class="findings-section">
        <h2>Audit Findings & Severity Ratings</h2>

        <!-- Finding 1 -->
        <div class="issue-card" data-severity="critical">
            <div class="issue-header">
                <div class="issue-title">Inverted Primary Action Contrast (Dark Mode)</div>
                <span class="badge critical">CRITICAL</span>
            </div>
            <div class="issue-body">
                In the Dark mode view, the "Try Again" button uses a white background with dark text. While this passes accessibility contrast checks technically, it creates a severe <strong>visual hierarchy inversion</strong>. 
                <br><br>
                Standard UI patterns dictate that primary actions in Dark Mode should use a high-luminance accent color (e.g., Blue/Purple) or a light gray surface. Using pure white (#FFF) for the primary button makes it compete visually with input fields or empty card states, reducing the affordance of the "Call to Action".
                <br><br>
                <strong>Recommendation:</strong> Change Dark Mode Primary Button to Brand Blue (#3b82f6) or Light Gray (#e5e7eb) to distinguish it from standard content backgrounds.
            </div>
            <div class="issue-meta">Location: CTA Button | WCAG Violation: None (Contrast OK), but UX Pattern Failure.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Finding 2 -->
        <div class="issue-card" data-severity="high">
            <div class="issue-header">
                <div class="issue-title">Wallet Selector / Form Context Missing</div>
                <span class="badge high">HIGH</span>
            </div>
            <div class="issue-body">
                The prompt requests an audit of the "Deposits page" and "Wallet Selector". However, the provided screenshots display only a generic <strong>Error Boundary/Fallback UI</strong>.
                <br><br>
                There is no Wallet Selector visible. If this error state appears <em>over</em> the deposit form, we cannot assess:
                <ul style="margin: 10px 0 10px 20px;">
                    <li>Readability of wallet addresses against the dark background.</li>
                    <li>Dropdown visibility for network selection.</li>
                </ul>
                <strong>Risk:</strong> If the user was in the middle of connecting a wallet, this generic error breaks the mental model of the transaction flow.
            </div>
            <div class="issue-meta">Context: Feature Visibility | Status: Component Missing from Viewport.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Finding 3 -->
        <div class="issue-card" data-severity="medium">
            <div class="issue-header">
                <div class="issue-title">Secondary Button Stroke Visibility</div>
                <span class="badge medium">MEDIUM</span>
            </div>
            <div class="issue-body">
                The "Go to Dashboard" and "Report Issue" buttons in Dark Mode rely on a subtle border (#374151) on a dark surface (#1f2937). 
                <br><br>
                The contrast ratio between the border and the background is approximately <strong>2.5:1</strong>, which fails AA standards for non-text UI components (requires 3:1). Users with low vision may struggle to identify these as clickable boundaries.
            </div>
            <div class="issue-meta">Location: Secondary Actions | WCAG 1.4.11 Non-text Contrast.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Finding 4 -->
        <div class="issue-card" data-severity="low">
            <div class="issue-header">
                <div class="issue-title">Icon Consistency (Light vs Dark)</div>
                <span class="badge low">LOW</span>
            </div>
            <div class="issue-body">
                The warning icon container in Light mode uses a soft red tint (`#fee2e2`), whereas Dark mode uses a very transparent red overlay.
                <br><br>
                The Dark mode icon circle lacks the "solidity" of the Light mode version, making the error state feel slightly less urgent or "floating". Consider slightly increasing the alpha of the background circle in Dark mode to match the visual weight of the Light variant.
            </div>
            <div class="issue-meta">Location: Alert Icon | Type: Visual Polish.</div>
        </div>

    </section>
</div>

</body>
</html>
